  "Target: the first Gallup release of the physical-health item from its November 2026 Health and Healthcare survey (national adults), the item quoted in study.item.",
  "Not scored, with the reason, if Gallup does not ask the item in November 2026, changes its wording or answer options, published the wave before this seal's OpenTimestamps attestation, or has not published it by 2027-06-30.",
  "Share: Excellent plus Good, each the whole-number percentage Gallup prints. Total: the topline (trend table) row for November 2026. Cells: the crosstab column of each group in study.cells, mapped as in study.cells_note; a group the release does not publish is not scored.",
  "Metric: absolute miss in points, for the forecast and for both sealed baselines. Headline = the national total. Beside it: the mean over the three cells (male, female, some college) and, separately, the White cell, whose mapping is inferred. The printed sum carries up to a point of rounding.",
  "Bands: whether each published share falls inside the sealed 80% and 95% bands.",
  "Claim: 'sealed before fieldwork' only if the wave's published fieldwork start is later than the attestation's block time; otherwise 'sealed before publication'."
 ]
